    {
      "id": "claim_d11cc08ba8894ce49744eed253401d09",
      "statement": "The cluster bootstrap workflow is split into two distinct phases: bootstrap:talos establishes the Kubernetes control plane from Talos machine configs, and bootstrap:apps installs essential infrastructure components (Cilium, CoreDNS, cert-manager, Flux) before handing off to continuous GitOps reconciliation.",
