      "id": "claim_d768599a76cf43b08f04ec834941199e",
      "statement": "bootstrap-apps.sh installs External DNS CRDs (v0.21.0) and Gateway API CRDs (v1.6.1) before Helm releases, which are also managed by Flux but duplicated in bootstrap for safety to ensure Cilium (which requires Gateway API) can start successfully.",
