      "statement": "Bootstrap Helm releases form a dependency chain: Cilium (requires Gateway API CRDs) → CoreDNS (requires Cilium) → cert-manager (requires CoreDNS) → flux-operator (requires cert-manager) → flux-instance (requires flux-operator).",
